WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.790 --> 00:00:07.620
The reselling aspect of sneaker
culture has changed everything

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:11.570
I think now is the biggest
time for sneakers in maybe

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:12.543
it's ever been.

00:00:12.543 --> 00:00:13.710
There's people taking money.

00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:16.293
And rather than investing in a
traditional asset classic stock

00:00:16.293 --> 00:00:17.827
or bond, they're
buying sneakers.

00:00:17.827 --> 00:00:19.410
And they're investing
in that sneaker.

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:21.915
And they're selling it
on an exchange later.

00:00:21.915 --> 00:00:25.230
There is a lot of money
to be made in this game.

00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:27.660
You could make 50 grand
in a weekend, man.

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:28.935
I've seen people do it.

00:00:28.935 --> 00:00:31.980
We estimate that there's over
$2bn in gross market value

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:32.520
overall.

00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:34.913
Footwear being resold
- we think StockX

00:00:34.913 --> 00:00:37.080
is the leader in this market
with gross market value

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:38.240
north of $1bn.

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:39.990
We connect buyers and
sellers the same way

00:00:39.990 --> 00:00:42.420
that the world's stock markets
connect buyers and sellers.

00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:45.060
Just like Apple doesn't
trade at the same price

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:48.090
every single day in
the market, nor does

00:00:48.090 --> 00:00:51.705
a particular sneaker trade for
the same price from day-to-day.

00:00:51.705 --> 00:00:55.013
Some people's closets, you look
at it and it's stock portfolio.

00:00:55.013 --> 00:00:56.430
There's some shoes
I love so much,

00:00:56.430 --> 00:00:58.755
I got 41 pairs of
the same exact shoes.

00:00:58.755 --> 00:01:00.930
Resell's all about
product allocation.

00:01:00.930 --> 00:01:03.578
It's all about who can get
it and where you sending it

00:01:03.578 --> 00:01:05.370
that the person is
willing to pay you more.

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:07.330
We think this market
can grow from $2bn

00:01:07.330 --> 00:01:09.080
to $6bn in a relatively
short time period.

00:01:16.065 --> 00:01:17.990
These days sneakers
are more like stocks

00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:19.890
than your average trainers.

00:01:19.890 --> 00:01:21.990
Prices up and down like
Wall Street, some experts

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:24.855
value the sneaker resale
market at over $2bn.

00:01:24.855 --> 00:01:27.420
And it could be $6bn by 2025.

